# Footer version (InPmnt)

Every shippable build must show the current software version as **plain searchable text**:

1. **`php/index.php`** — comment line `InPmnt vX.Y.Z` (so a file text search finds it)
2. **Landing `/`** — footer `InPmnt vX.Y.Z` and in `<title>`
3. **App shell `/app`** — bottom bar `InPmnt vX.Y.Z` and in `<title>`
4. Keep `VERSION`, `php/VERSION`, and `Http::VERSION` in lockstep

Never rely only on a buried sidebar label or a CSS `?v=` query string.
